Question: Type '"/confirmation"' is not assignable to type 'RelativePathString | ExternalPathString | "/explore" | "/" | "/_sitemap"'.
Answer: 
The error is from stale Expo Router types. 
The generated routes in router.d.ts still list /explore, even though that route is gone, 
and don’t list the new confirmation.tsx.
Stop the Expo dev server and restart it with:
That should regenerate the route types. Also, confirmation.tsx appears empty, so make sure it exports a default screen component.

